WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.400
Most explainers start with a talking head.
This one starts with the point.

00:02.600 --> 00:05.500
Now the face arrives, small, like a hero image.

00:05.700 --> 00:08.900
Then it fills the frame, and the words come over it.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.900
At the end it steps aside, and the text sits beside it.
